Devsisters has partnered with Big Shot Pictures to adapt its CookieRun franchise into a feature-length film.&nbsp;

The film will target a global release in 2029 to coincide with the 20th anniversary of the original game. Big Shot Pictures will lead production, while Devsisters will work with the company on the film&rsquo;s creative direction.&nbsp; ... [<a href="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/devsisters-partners-with-big-shot-pictures-for-cookierun-film/">MORE</a>]
